    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a top-down survivor game developed using the Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are about to embark on a thrilling and exciting journey of intense battles, teamwork, and unique creativity, as well as an endless frenzy of survival games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136000/extras/a524cb06d449cbf6dc2387a51379b700.poster.avif?t=1731356222\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136000/extras/a524cb06d449cbf6dc2387a51379b700.webm?t=1731356222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136000/extras/a524cb06d449cbf6dc2387a51379b700.mp4?t=1731356222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will play as a warrior, leveling up by killing enemies and learning various skills to eliminate more enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can choose different heroes to acquire basic skills and start the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, there are over 200 skills and over 1000 attribute entries (still increasing) for you to match, form bonds, explore stronger combinations, and summon bombers to fight for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade enemy attacks, kill enemies, encounter bosses, arm yourself in upgrades,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the support of Unreal Engine, it has excellent special effects and supports up to 10000 monsters on the same screen. Kill them to your heart's content.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a top-down survivor game developed using the Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are about to embark on a thrilling and exciting journey of intense battles, teamwork, and unique creativity, as well as an endless frenzy of survival games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136000/extras/a524cb06d449cbf6dc2387a51379b700.poster.avif?t=1731356222\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136000/extras/a524cb06d449cbf6dc2387a51379b700.webm?t=1731356222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136000/extras/a524cb06d449cbf6dc2387a51379b700.mp4?t=1731356222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will play as a warrior, leveling up by killing enemies and learning various skills to eliminate more enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can choose different heroes to acquire basic skills and start the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, there are over 200 skills and over 1000 attribute entries (still increasing) for you to match, form bonds, explore stronger combinations, and summon bombers to fight for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade enemy attacks, kill enemies, encounter bosses, arm yourself in upgrades,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the support of Unreal Engine, it has excellent special effects and supports up to 10000 monsters on the same screen. Kill them to your heart's content.</p>",
